    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="31">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIAtr">VI Atr</ref> 31</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="31" corresp="#wit-d-incomplete">Wytan eac ealle ymbe friðes bote ⁊ ymbe féos bote smeagan swiðe georne:</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#robertson" n="31" corresp="#wit-k">Wutan eac ealle ymbe friþes bote ⁊ ymbe feos bote smeagean swyðe georne.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#rabin-doml" corresp="#wit-k">Wutan eac ealle ymbe friþes bote and ymbe feos bote smeagean swyðe georne.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#robertson" corresp="#wit-k">Further, let us all earnestly take thought for the promotion of public security and the improvement of the coinage.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#rabin-doml" corresp="#wit-k">Let us all also consider very carefully the enhancement of public safety and the improvement of the currency.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">Lasst uns auch alle auf Besserung öffentlicher Sicherheit und auf Besserung der Münze recht ernsthaft bedacht sein:</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">Let us also all very earnestly consider the improvement of public security and the improvement of the coinage:</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
